# The two-guest package-mode plan builds a test image on a separate harness VM,
# reboots that harness into image mode, and transfers the OCI archive to target.
# This test installs that image onto the package-mode target, reboots it, then
# verifies the preserved /var data and merged /etc configuration.
summary: Package-mode /var preservation and /etc merge
duration: 45m
adjust:
  - when: running_env == image_mode
    enabled: false
    because: this migration test requires a package-mode target
test: bash booted/package-mode/test-to-existing-root-preserve-var-merge-etc.sh
